      "message": "also this doesn\u0027t resolve the cases as follow\n\n2 tasks running on the same rq:\n1) clamped task A --\u003e util.avg 200 when running without uclamp.max, bigger than 200 with uclamp.max\n2) unclamped task B --\u003e util.avg 200\n\nIf there is no uclamp setting A is running shorter and its util.avg is 200 and cfs_rq is 400. But when clamped A such its util.avg grows further beyond 200 and when B enqueued, the util of rq and thus the freq could be spike up to the very inefficient frequency point.",
